<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>更新快照 - Conda环境快照管理系统</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>Conda环境快照管理系统</h1>
            <div class="user-info">
                <span>当前用户: <%= user.username %></span>
                <a href="/logout" class="logout">退出登录</a>
            </div>
        </header>
        
        <nav>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="/view">查询快照</a></li>
                <li><a href="/report">创建快照</a></li>
                <li><a href="/history">快照历史</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
        
        <main>
            <h2>更新环境快照</h2>
            <p>修改以下信息后提交，将更新该快照的内容（<code>conda list</code>文本修改后会重新解析包信息）。</p>
            
            <form action="/update/<%= snapshot._id %>" method="post">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="environmentName">环境名称 <span class="required">*</span>:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="environmentName" name="environmentName" required 
                           value="<%= snapshot.environmentName %>" placeholder="如: base, py38">
                </div>
                
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="environmentType">环境类型 <span class="required">*</span>:</label>
                    <select id="environmentType" name="environmentType" required>
                        <option value="正式环境" <%= snapshot.environmentType === '正式环境' ? 'selected' : '' %>>正式环境</option>
                        <option value="预览环境" <%= snapshot.environmentType === '预览环境' ? 'selected' : '' %>>预览环境</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
                
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="description">描述:</label>
                    <textarea id="description" name="description" rows="3" placeholder="可选：描述此环境的用途、特点等"><%= snapshot.description || '' %></textarea>
                </div>
                
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="rawText">Conda环境列表 <span class="required">*</span>:</label>
                    <textarea id="rawText" name="rawText" rows="15" required placeholder="粘贴conda list命令的输出结果（从包列表开始，不包含注释行）"><%= snapshot.rawText %></textarea>
                    <p class="hint">当前解析出 <%= snapshot.packages.length %> 个包，修改文本后会重新解析。</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="form-group">
                    <button type="submit">保存更新</button>
                    <a href="/history" style="margin-left: 10px; padding: 12px 20px; background-color: #6c757d; color: white; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none;">取消</a>
                </div>
            </form>

            <!-- 展示当前解析的包列表预览 -->
            <div class="form-group" style="margin-top: 30px;">
                <h3>当前包列表预览（<%= snapshot.packages.length %> 个）</h3>
                <div class="package-list">
                    <% snapshot.packages.forEach(pkg => { %>
                        <div class="package-item">
                            <strong><%= pkg.name %></strong> - 版本: <%= pkg.version %> | 构建: <%= pkg.build || '无' %> | 渠道: <%= pkg.channel || '无' %>
                        </div>
                    <% }) %>
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>
    </div>
</body>
</html>